## Title: KillCount
## APIVersion: 101049 101050
## Version: 3.10.0
## AddOnVersion: 3100
## Author: Dreadazar
## Description: Small pinned K/D box in the bottom-right for PvP. Overall daily K/D with your current zone underneath - Cyrodiil, Imperial City, Battlegrounds and Duels tracked separately. Shows the day's most-killed player. Resets every 24 hours.
## SavedVariables: KillCountVars

KillCount.lua
